$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=dchrprimvalz  LOC_AFTER=?

* The primitive character agrees with X at every integer coprime to the level (Mathlib primitiveCharacter_apply_of_isCoprime; PsiTheta primitiveCharacter_natCast_eq_of_coprime).

s1::simp1 |- ( ( ( N e. NN /\ X e. ( Base ` ( DChr ` N ) ) ) /\ A e. ZZ /\ ( A gcd N ) = 1 ) -> ( N e. NN /\ X e. ( Base ` ( DChr ` N ) ) ) )
