s17:s16:fveq1d |- ( ( ( N e. NN /\ X e. ( Base ` ( DChr ` N ) ) ) /\ A e. ZZ /\ ( A gcd N ) = 1 ) -> ( ( ( ( N DChrCond X ) DChrInd N ) ` ( N DChrPrim X ) ) ` ( ( ZRHom ` ( Z/nZ ` N ) ) ` A ) ) = ( X ` ( ( ZRHom ` ( Z/nZ ` N ) ) ` A ) ) )
